# Core Stack — 5F Enterprise Template

You are an expert in TypeScript, React 19, Vite 7, Tailwind CSS v4, React Router v7, and Vietnamese ERP admin UIs.

## Stack (this project)

- **Language:** TypeScript strict — no `any`; use `unknown` + type guards
- **UI:** React 19 functional components only (no class components)
- **Build:** Vite 7 (`npm run dev`, port 5173)
- **Routing:** `react-router-dom` v7
- **Styling:** Tailwind CSS v4 (`@import "tailwindcss"` in `index.css`, `@theme` tokens)
- **Icons:** Lucide React
- **Motion:** `framer-motion` (already installed)
- **Dates:** `dayjs` (already installed — do not add moment/dayjs alternatives)
- **Toasts:** Sonner
- **Charts:** Recharts
- **Monitoring:** Sentry (`@sentry/react`)
- **PWA:** `vite-plugin-pwa`
- **Backend:** Supabase (Auth + PostgreSQL)
- **Testing:** Vitest + Testing Library
- **Lint/Format:** ESLint 10 + Prettier

## Code Style

- Functional and declarative patterns; avoid classes
- Prefer iteration and modularization over duplication
- Descriptive names with auxiliary verbs: `isLoading`, `hasError`, `canDelete`
- Use `@/*` path aliases — never cross-folder relative imports like `../../lib/...`
- Use `cn()` from `lib/utils` for conditional Tailwind classes (clsx + tailwind-merge)

## TypeScript

- Strict mode everywhere; explicit return types on exported functions
- Prefer `interface` for object shapes; use `type` for unions/intersections
- Avoid enums — use `const` objects + `as const` + derived union types
- Infer form types from Zod schemas (`z.infer<typeof schema>`)

## React

- Do not import `React` by default (React 19 JSX transform)
- Keep components focused on rendering; extract logic to custom hooks
- Component target: ≤150 lines; function target: ≤30 lines
- Use Suspense boundaries where async UI is needed
- Vietnamese UI copy via `txt()` from `lib/text` — do not hardcode strings in new modules when a key exists

## Tailwind v4

- Design tokens via `@theme` in `index.css`
- Border radius convention:
  - `rounded-lg` — form controls (input, select, textarea, button sm/default)
  - `rounded-xl` — cards, panels, dropdown lists
  - `rounded-2xl` — modal, drawer, dialog, MainCard
- Dark mode supported — respect existing theme switching

## Banned

- `any`, class components, CSS-in-JS (styled-components, emotion)
- Redux, MobX, Formik, Yup
- Adding Prisma, Better Auth, or alternate backend without explicit approval
- Default/generic AI aesthetics (Inter font, purple gradients) — follow `06-project-5f.mdc`

## Verification before merge

Run: `npm run lint:ci` · `npm run test` · `npm run build`
